From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 21:30:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] A completed markdown body keeps its projection (blocks and
 their tokens) in a module cache keyed by its cache key while its text is
 unchanged, capped at 1024 entries and 4 MB of text, so a session return
 remounts a 131 KB reply from the block cache without lexing it again (about
 55 ms in V8 with today's autolink start search, about 5 ms without it), and
 the line budget is the measured 107,785.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QtZVtcNTgBwKhSN8i2v1w2
